entences\":null},{\"title\":\"Personalize and optimize content with Adobe Target\",\"uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/personalize-and-optimize-content-with-adobe-target\",\"printableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/personalize-and-optimize-content-with-adobe-target\",\"clickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/personalize-and-optimize-content-with-adobe-target\",\"uniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/personalize-and-optimize-content-with-adobe-target\",\"primaryid\":\"NNUWIYJQJ5JWWSCIMJXXEYTJIUXDENBZGY4C4ZDFMZQXK3DU\",\"excerpt\":\"Personalize and Optimize Content with Adobe Target is a recorded course where you will learn the core concepts and capabilities of Adobe Target. ... Through scenario-based activities, you will learn to create A/B activities (manual, auto-allocate,...\",\"firstSentences\":null,\"summary\":null,\"flags\":\"HasHtmlVersion;HasAllMetaDataStream\",\"hasHtmlVersion\":true,\"hasMobileHtmlVersion\":false,\"score\":502,\"percentScore\":86.23826,\"rankingInfo\":null,\"rating\":0,\"isTopResult\":false,\"isRecommendation\":false,\"isUserActionView\":false,\"titleHighlights\":[],\"firstSentencesHighlights\":[],\"excerptHighlights\":[],\"printableUriHighlights\":[],\"summaryHighlights\":[],\"parentResult\":null,\"childResults\":[],\"totalNumberOfChildResults\":0,\"absentTerms\":[],\"raw\":{\"el_type\":\"Course\",\"sysurihash\":\"kida0OSkHHborbiE\",\"urihash\":\"kida0OSkHHborbiE\",\"exl_description\":\"Personalize and Optimize Content with Adobe Target is a recorded course where you will learn the core concepts and capabilities of Adobe Target. Through scenario-based activities, you will learn to create A/B activities (manual, auto-allocate, template, and multipage) using the Visual Experience Composer (VEC); build visitor audiences for Experience Targeting (XT); manage and create offers; and know when and how to interpret activity report results. This course also covers the content optimization and test design process, including the campaign strategy, optimization goals, benefits of using Analytics as Reporting Source for Target (A4T), roles and responsibilities involved in the optimization program, and activity conflict resolution.  After completing this course, you should be able to:  - Explain Target’s key features and benefits.  - Explain content optimization and test design strategy.  - Create A/B activities and perform QA.  - Interpret A/B reports.  - Create audiences in Target.  - Create an XT activity.  - Create an A4T activity.  - Plan A/B test duration using test calculator.  - Customize \\\"Adobe Analytics For Target (A4T)\\\" reports in Analysis Workspace.\",\"documenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"permanentid\":\"c44bc8e9ead49699553a68e6f3c79d6c1f01422bc938f25ffeb2daeafd2b\",\"syslanguage\":[\"English\"],\"el_product\":[\"Target\"],\"el_level\":[\"Beginner\"],\"date\":1795392000000,\"sourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"sysconnectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"sysdocumenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"syssource\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"sysdate\":1795392000000,\"type\":[\"Course\"],\"source\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"collection\":\"default\",\"el_contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"syssourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"el_solution\":[\"Target\"],\"connectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"filetype\":\"html\",\"sysfiletype\":\"html\",\"language\":[\"English\"],\"role\":\"User\",\"syscollection\":\"default\"},\"Title\":\"Personalize and optimize content with Adobe Target\",\"Uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/personalize-and-optimize-content-with-adobe-target\",\"PrintableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/personalize-and-optimize-content-with-adobe-target\",\"ClickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/personalize-and-optimize-content-with-adobe-target\",\"UniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/personalize-and-optimize-content-with-adobe-target\",\"Excerpt\":\"Personalize and Optimize Content with Adobe Target is a recorded course where you will learn the core concepts and capabilities of Adobe Target. ... Through scenario-based activities, you will learn to create A/B activities (manual, auto-allocate,...\",\"FirstSentences\":null},{\"title\":\"Manage and deliver digital assets using Adobe Experience Manager\",\"uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/manage-and-deliver-digital-assets-using-adobe-experience-manager\",\"printableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/manage-and-deliver-digital-assets-using-adobe-experience-manager\",\"clickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/manage-and-deliver-digital-assets-using-adobe-experience-manager\",\"uniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/manage-and-deliver-digital-assets-using-adobe-experience-manager\",\"primaryid\":\"ORYHGTDIN5JDI5KNGVEVQMCTI4XDENBZGY4C4ZDFMZQXK3DU\",\"excerpt\":\"Adobe Experience Manager (AEM) Assets provides you with a Digital Asset Manager (DAM) as a single source repository of all corporate assets. ... In this course you will learn how to set up a shared folder for corporate assets, how to use Dynamic M...\",\"firstSentences\":null,\"summary\":null,\"flags\":\"HasHtmlVersion;HasAllMetaDataStream\",\"hasHtmlVersion\":true,\"hasMobileHtmlVersion\":false,\"score\":502,\"percentScore\":86.23826,\"rankingInfo\":null,\"rating\":0,\"isTopResult\":false,\"isRecommendation\":false,\"isUserActionView\":false,\"titleHighlights\":[],\"firstSentencesHighlights\":[],\"excerptHighlights\":[],\"printableUriHighlights\":[],\"summaryHighlights\":[],\"parentResult\":null,\"childResults\":[],\"totalNumberOfChildResults\":0,\"absentTerms\":[],\"raw\":{\"el_type\":\"Course\",\"sysurihash\":\"tpsLhoR4uM5IX0SG\",\"urihash\":\"tpsLhoR4uM5IX0SG\",\"exl_description\":\"Adobe Experience Manager (AEM) Assets provides you with a Digital Asset Manager (DAM) as a single source repository of all corporate assets. In this course you will learn how to set up a shared folder for corporate assets, how to use Dynamic Media for rendition management at scale and share renditions using URLs and embed codes with both internal and external users, and how to publish digital assets to the Brand Portal. This course includes video demonstrations of activities.  After completing this course, you should be able to:  - Navigate through the asset interface.  - Organize and manage assets.  - Manage asset metadata.  - Search for assets.  - Manage business processes.  - Work with Dynamic Media.  - Distribute assets using Brand Portal.\",\"documenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"permanentid\":\"717bdad306c3b3205f5a180957b7fd001f01245656b7f536a043ab9a7fa3\",\"syslanguage\":[\"English\"],\"el_product\":[\"Experience Manager\",\"Experience Manager Assets\"],\"el_level\":[\"Beginner\"],\"date\":1795392000000,\"sourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"sysconnectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"sysdocumenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"syssource\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"sysdate\":1795392000000,\"type\":[\"Course\"],\"source\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"collection\":\"default\",\"el_contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"syssourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"el_solution\":[\"Experience Manager,Experience Manager Assets\"],\"connectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"filetype\":\"html\",\"sysfiletype\":\"html\",\"language\":[\"English\"],\"role\":\"User\",\"syscollection\":\"default\"},\"Title\":\"Manage and deliver digital assets using Adobe Experience Manager\",\"Uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/manage-and-deliver-digital-assets-using-adobe-experience-manager\",\"PrintableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/manage-and-deliver-digital-assets-using-adobe-experience-manager\",\"ClickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/manage-and-deliver-digital-assets-using-adobe-experience-manager\",\"UniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/manage-and-deliver-digital-assets-using-adobe-experience-manager\",\"Excerpt\":\"Adobe Experience Manager (AEM) Assets provides you with a Digital Asset Manager (DAM) as a single source repository of all corporate assets. ... In this course you will learn how to set up a shared folder for corporate assets, how to use Dynamic M...\",\"FirstSentences\":null},{\"title\":\"Author and manage pages using sites\",\"uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/author-and-manage-pages-using-sites\",\"printableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/author-and-manage-pages-using-sites\",\"clickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/author-and-manage-pages-using-sites\",\"uniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/author-and-manage-pages-using-sites\",\"primaryid\":\"OQYMHMKKKBFDM4ZWPFKXGN2ZKRAS4MRUHE3DQLTEMVTGC5LMOQ\",\"excerpt\":\"Author and manage pages using sites is an on-demand course where you will learn the fundamentals of page and content creation in Adobe Experience Manager Sites. ... Through video lessons, you will learn to build rich content and well-branded pages...\",\"firstSentences\":null,\"summary\":null,\"flags\":\"HasHtmlVersion;HasAllMetaDataStream\",\"hasHtmlVersion\":true,\"hasMobileHtmlVersion\":false,\"score\":502,\"percentScore\":86.23826,\"rankingInfo\":null,\"rating\":0,\"isTopResult\":false,\"isRecommendation\":false,\"isUserActionView\":false,\"titleHighlights\":[],\"firstSentencesHighlights\":[],\"excerptHighlights\":[],\"printableUriHighlights\":[],\"summaryHighlights\":[],\"parentResult\":null,\"childResults\":[],\"totalNumberOfChildResults\":0,\"absentTerms\":[],\"raw\":{\"el_type\":\"Course\",\"sysauthor\":\"-;-;-\",\"sysurihash\":\"t0ñJPJ6s6yUs7YTA\",\"urihash\":\"t0ñJPJ6s6yUs7YTA\",\"exl_description\":\"Author and Manage Pages using Sites I is an on-demand course where you will learn the fundamentals of page and content creation in Adobe Experience Manager Sites. Through video lessons, you will learn to build rich content and well-branded pages with different component actions. You'll also learn how to structure pages with containers and responsive layouts that can be rendered on browsers, tablets, and smartphones. Content flow for a global website will be discussed, along with publishing, workflows, page versioning, and many other common management actions.  This course is designed for Content Authors with basic understanding of content management for websites. The lessons in this course focus on page creation, templates, components and containers, content reusability, workflows, and translations. The estimated seat time for this course is 24 hours.  What You'll Learn In this course, you will learn how to:  - Create pages, templates, and components.  - Understand component containers.  - Reuse content using Experience Fragments and Content Fragments.  - Participate in workflows.  - Contribute to localized sites and translations.\",\"documenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"permanentid\":\"a3c3b5b55ee4160c4e8ad46f3656a189cd4093ccdb857894387181264534\",\"syslanguage\":[\"English\"],\"el_product\":[\"Experience Manager Sites\",\"Experience Manager\"],\"el_level\":[\"Beginner\"],\"date\":1795392000000,\"sourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"sysconnectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"sysdocumenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"syssource\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"sysdate\":1795392000000,\"author\":\"-;-;-\",\"type\":[\"Course\"],\"source\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"collection\":\"default\",\"el_contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"syssourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"el_solution\":[\"Experience Manager Sites,Experience Manager\"],\"connectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"filetype\":\"html\",\"sysfiletype\":\"html\",\"language\":[\"English\"],\"role\":\"User\",\"syscollection\":\"default\"},\"Title\":\"Author and manage pages using sites\",\"Uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/author-and-manage-pages-using-sites\",\"PrintableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/author-and-manage-pages-using-sites\",\"ClickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/author-and-manage-pages-using-sites\",\"UniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/author-and-manage-pages-using-sites\",\"Excerpt\":\"Author and manage pages using sites is an on-demand course where you will learn the fundamentals of page and content creation in Adobe Experience Manager Sites. ... Through video lessons, you will learn to build rich content and well-branded pages...\",\"FirstSentences\":null},{\"title\":\"Personalization with AEM, Adobe Target and Experience Platform\",\"uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/aem-personalization\",\"printableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/aem-personalization\",\"clickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/aem-personalization\",\"uniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/aem-personalization\",\"primaryid\":\"IVIHS5LCPDB3A5JUYOYFKZKLPBHWQLRSGQ4TMOBOMRSWMYLVNR2A\",\"excerpt\":\"In this course, you will learn how to connect Experience Manager with Target and Experience Platform to deliver personalized experiences, ranging from A/B testing to behavioral targeting and known-user personalization. ... Product: Experience Mana...\",\"firstSentences\":null,\"summary\":null,\"flags\":\"HasHtmlVersion;HasAllMetaDataStream\",\"hasHtmlVersion\":true,\"hasMobileHtmlVersion\":false,\"score\":502,\"percentScore\":86.23826,\"rankingInfo\":null,\"rating\":0,\"isTopResult\":false,\"isRecommendation\":false,\"isUserActionView\":false,\"titleHighlights\":[],\"firstSentencesHighlights\":[],\"excerptHighlights\":[],\"printableUriHighlights\":[],\"summaryHighlights\":[],\"parentResult\":null,\"childResults\":[],\"totalNumberOfChildResults\":0,\"absentTerms\":[],\"raw\":{\"el_type\":\"Course\",\"sysurihash\":\"EPyubxðu4ðUeKxOh\",\"urihash\":\"EPyubxðu4ðUeKxOh\",\"exl_description\":\"Learn how to create personalized experiences with AEM websites with Adobe Target and Experience Platform.\",\"documenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"permanentid\":\"5884f65161cfd2dfc8a9a10269dcda85e5c00a3d2b01a593d4127ed42dea\",\"syslanguage\":[\"English\"],\"el_product\":[\"Experience Manager Sites\",\"Target\",\"Experience Platform\",\"Experience Manager\"],\"el_level\":[\"Experienced\"],\"date\":1795392000000,\"sourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"sysconnectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"sysdocumenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"syssource\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"sysdate\":1795392000000,\"type\":[\"Course\"],\"source\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"collection\":\"default\",\"el_contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"syssourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"el_solution\":[\"Experience Manager Sites,Target,Experience Platform,Experience Manager\"],\"connectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"filetype\":\"html\",\"sysfiletype\":\"html\",\"language\":[\"English\"],\"role\":\"Developer\",\"syscollection\":\"default\"},\"Title\":\"Personalization with AEM, Adobe Target and Experience Platform\",\"Uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/aem-personalization\",\"PrintableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/aem-personalization\",\"ClickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/aem-personalization\",\"UniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/aem-personalization\",\"Excerpt\":\"In this course, you will learn how to connect Experience Manager with Target and Experience Platform to deliver personalized experiences, ranging from A/B testing to behavioral targeting and known-user personalization. ... Product: Experience Mana...\",\"FirstSentences\":null},{\"title\":\"Create and analyze reports using Adobe Customer Journey Analytics\",\"uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-and-analyze-reports-using-adobe-customer-journey-analytics\",\"printableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-and-analyze-reports-using-adobe-customer-journey-analytics\",\"clickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-and-analyze-reports-using-adobe-customer-journey-analytics\",\"uniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-and-analyze-reports-using-adobe-customer-journey-analytics\",\"primaryid\":\"NZ3UKVDBGZCWIQSBGM4DK43HNEXDENBZGY4C4ZDFMZQXK3DU\",\"excerpt\":\"Create and Analyze Reports Using Adobe Customer Journey Analytics is a recorded virtual course where you will learn to create reports and dashboards that illustrate multi-channel and cross-channel traffic and capture conversion data. ... Product: ...\",\"firstSentences\":null,\"summary\":null,\"flags\":\"HasHtmlVersion;HasAllMetaDataStream\",\"hasHtmlVersion\":true,\"hasMobileHtmlVersion\":false,\"score\":502,\"percentScore\":86.23826,\"rankingInfo\":null,\"rating\":0,\"isTopResult\":false,\"isRecommendation\":false,\"isUserActionView\":false,\"titleHighlights\":[],\"firstSentencesHighlights\":[],\"excerptHighlights\":[],\"printableUriHighlights\":[],\"summaryHighlights\":[],\"parentResult\":null,\"childResults\":[],\"totalNumberOfChildResults\":0,\"absentTerms\":[],\"raw\":{\"el_type\":\"Course\",\"sysurihash\":\"nwETa6EdBA385sgi\",\"urihash\":\"nwETa6EdBA385sgi\",\"exl_description\":\"Create and Analyze Reports Using Adobe Customer Journey Analytics is a recorded virtual course where you will learn to create reports and dashboards that illustrate multi-channel and cross-channel traffic and capture conversion data. Through hands-on activities and demonstrations, you will create cross-channel comparative analysis reports using filters and calculated metrics, publish targeted audiences to Adobe Experience Platform, and share projects.  Prerequisites: None. However, basic knowledge of Adobe Analytics is helpful.  After completing this course, you should be able to:  - Explain the difference between Adobe Analytics and Customer Journey Analytics.  - Describe Customer Journey Analytics as an omnichannel analytics tool.  - Create multi-channel and cross-channel reports in Customer Journey Analytics.  - Create comparative analysis reports using Filters and Metrics.  - Publish audience and share projects.\",\"documenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"permanentid\":\"d32d0137cee2f74321aed8dba381a3ca6d8f1d567770a4062c1ae6b99f84\",\"syslanguage\":[\"English\"],\"el_product\":[\"Customer Journey Analytics\"],\"el_level\":[\"Beginner\"],\"date\":1795392000000,\"sourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"sysconnectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"sysdocumenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"syssource\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"sysdate\":1795392000000,\"type\":[\"Course\"],\"source\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"collection\":\"default\",\"el_contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"syssourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"el_solution\":[\"Customer Journey Analytics\"],\"connectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"filetype\":\"html\",\"sysfiletype\":\"html\",\"language\":[\"English\"],\"role\":\"User\",\"syscollection\":\"default\"},\"Title\":\"Create and analyze reports using Adobe Customer Journey Analytics\",\"Uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-and-analyze-reports-using-adobe-customer-journey-analytics\",\"PrintableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-and-analyze-reports-using-adobe-customer-journey-analytics\",\"ClickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-and-analyze-reports-using-adobe-customer-journey-analytics\",\"UniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-and-analyze-reports-using-adobe-customer-journey-analytics\",\"Excerpt\":\"Create and Analyze Reports Using Adobe Customer Journey Analytics is a recorded virtual course where you will learn to create reports and dashboards that illustrate multi-channel and cross-channel traffic and capture conversion data. ... Product: ...\",\"FirstSentences\":null},{\"title\":\"Create reports and visualizations using Adobe Analytics I\",\"uri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-reports-and-visualizations-using-adobe-analytics-i\",\"printableUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-reports-and-visualizations-using-adobe-analytics-i\",\"clickUri\":\"https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-reports-and-visualizations-using-adobe-analytics-i\",\"uniqueId\":\"42.24968$https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/courses/create-reports-and-visualizations-using-adobe-analytics-i\",\"primaryid\":\"GFUVO3TGJNEFSNKJLJVTQQRTIEXDENBZGY4C4ZDFMZQXK3DU\",\"excerpt\":\"Create Reports and Visualizations Using Adobe Analytics I is an on-demand course, where you will learn how to navigate the reporting interface, create engaging reports and visualizations to get answers to your business questions, and configure rep...\",\"firstSentences\":null,\"summary\":null,\"flags\":\"HasHtmlVersion;HasAllMetaDataStream\",\"hasHtmlVersion\":true,\"hasMobileHtmlVersion\":false,\"score\":502,\"percentScore\":86.23826,\"rankingInfo\":null,\"rating\":0,\"isTopResult\":false,\"isRecommendation\":false,\"isUserActionView\":false,\"titleHighlights\":[],\"firstSentencesHighlights\":[],\"excerptHighlights\":[],\"printableUriHighlights\":[],\"summaryHighlights\":[],\"parentResult\":null,\"childResults\":[],\"totalNumberOfChildResults\":0,\"absentTerms\":[],\"raw\":{\"el_type\":\"Course\",\"sysurihash\":\"1iWnfKHY5IZk8B3A\",\"urihash\":\"1iWnfKHY5IZk8B3A\",\"exl_description\":\"Create Reports and Visualizations Using Adobe Analytics I is an on-demand course, where you will learn how to navigate the reporting interface, create engaging reports and visualizations to get answers to your business questions, and configure reports for effective decision-making using Adobe Analytics. Through videos, you will learn about Adobe’s 4-step methodology and create reports and visualizations in Analysis Workspace to analyze visitor acquisition, visitor identification, visitor activity, and visitor retention. You will learn how to create custom Segments and Calculated Metrics to customize your reports and visualizations. This course is suitable for business users and analysts.  What You'll Learn In this course, you will learn how to:  - Create reports and visualizations in Adobe Analytics to analyze:  - Visitor acquisition to understand how visitors come to your website.  - Visitor identification to understand who your visitors are.  - Visitor activity and content consumption to understand what visitors do on your website.  - Visitor retention to understand how many of your visitors keep coming back.  - Create quick Segments in reports and custom Segments using Segment Builder for your unique reporting needs.  - Create custom Calculated Metrics in Calculated Metric Builder for your unique reporting needs.  - Understand customization ideas and techniques and how to use them to customize dimensions and metrics for your organization.\",\"documenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"permanentid\":\"72132f5584574d9dc3436442264cd4fbea148d8bbc8b5427f938dd6f173f\",\"syslanguage\":[\"English\"],\"el_product\":[\"Analytics\"],\"el_level\":[\"Beginner\"],\"date\":1795392000000,\"sourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"sysconnectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"sysdocumenttype\":\"WebPage\",\"syssource\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"sysdate\":1795392000000,\"type\":[\"Course\"],\"source\":\"Experience League - UE content - Production\",\"collection\":\"default\",\"el_contenttype\":[\"Course\"],\"syssourcetype\":\"Sitemap\",\"el_solution\":[\"Analytics\"],\"connectortype\":\"SitemapCrawler\",\"filetype\":\"html\",\"sysfiletype\":\"html\",\"language\":[\"English\"],\"role\":\"User\",\"syscollection\":\"default\"},\"Title\":\"Create reports and visualizations using Adobe Analytics I\",\"Uri\":\"https